  triage:description "docs/plans/phase-AD/sprint-AD25.md:112-114 documents `atm teams set-nudge-template --team <team> --kind <kind> --template-body <body>` (flag syntax). Actual implementation in crates/atm/src/commands/teams.rs:97-125 has `team`/`kind` as positional args (no #[arg(long)]), consistent with existing add-member/update-member convention in the same file." ;
